# All professions on one character (change m1b-all-professions). Needs MaxPrimaryTradeSkill = 11 (write-confs.ps1)
# and the test character Arpgtest online (the overnight pipeline holds it in the world with the headless client).

> .arpg test learnall Arpgtest
? professions=11 of 11

# --- ArpgUI professions panel line (m1b 2.1): all 11 listed with skill; crafting ones carry the spell that opens their window.
> .arpg test professions Arpgtest
? ARPGT\|171:\d+:\d+:[1-9]\d*;164:\d+:\d+:[1-9]\d*;333:\d+:\d+:[1-9]\d*;202:
? ARPGT\|(\d+:\d+:\d+:\d+;){10}\d+:\d+:\d+:\d+\s*$
